// The viability run (design §7.6, v24): the default world, with no player,
// for 50,000 ticks. A4 reads, over the last window, how many young sprites
// born in the world grew up and what killed grown sprites, by life stage;
// the thorn trap counts deaths by thornbush over the first, as
// `thorn-trap.ron` does on the same worlds. Baseline runs use it on seeds
// 1–10:
// cargo run --release -p terra-sim --example lab -- scenarios/viability.ron --seeds 10
(
    world: Generated,
    ticks: 50000,
    windows: [(0, 30000), (0, 50000)],
)
